<title>UK: Abbey National yr pretax profit rises 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Abbey National yr pretax profit rises 20 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Feb 27 Reuter) - Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		59.8		   vs 51.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 17.4		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 26.1		   vs 21.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     1,228		  vs 1,026</p>
<p> Group assets (bln)     124		    up 20 pct</p>
<p> Bad debt provision     127		    vs 72</p>
<p>NOTE - The pretax profit and earnings per share figures exclude integration costs from the merger with National and Provincial. Including integration costs, pretax profit rose to 1.167 billion stg from 1.026 billion and earnings per share rose to 56.5p.  </p>
<p> Net interest income    1,794		 vs 1,584</p>
<p> Interest margin (pct)  1.76		  vs 1.71</p>
<p>Pretax by business:</p>
<p>  UK retail banking     736		   vs 687</p>
<p>  Consumer credit	 98		    vs 49</p>
<p>  Life assurance	  151		   vs 105</p>
<p>  Treasury and Offshore 256		   vs 217</p>
<p>  Continental Europe    19 loss	     vs 22 loss</p>
<p>  Other operations	6		     vs 10 loss</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
